      "description": "Dr. Alvin® Ceramoist Barrier Repair Cream 10g. --- Perfect for restoring moisture and protecting your skin’s natural barrier\n\n♦ An excellent hypoallergenic moisturizer for those with sensitive skin. It’s like a soothing blanket for your face. The five essential ceramides help repair the skin’s protective barrier, so it can lock in moisture and keep irritants out. Think of it as rebuilding your skin’s fence. This cream gives your skin a deep drink of hydration that lasts, leaving it feeling soft and healthy.\n\n♦ Ceramoist Barrier Repair Cream is a hypoallergenic, dermatologist-tested formula designed for sensitive skin, offering deep hydration and barrier protection. Enriched with five essential ceramides, it restores the skin's natural defenses while locking in moisture for long-lasting hydration. Soothing ingredients like aloe vera and chamomile provide relief from redness and irritation, leaving skin soft, smooth, and resilient.",
